{"1448000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "迷离诡夜 blurred weird night", "steam_appid": 1448000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by only one person, and it will be updated irregularly! If you have any problems, please join the QQ group 140130929 to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introduction to the enhanced version of the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send a box to the boss, but unexpectedly get trapped in a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chased by a big-breasted female ghost and a chainsaw man.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several beautiful girls are trapped and it's very dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you want to save them or choose to escape alone?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different choices lead to different results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you have a romance in a horror game by being a hero to save the beauty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ending is? You must cure either your lechery or your fear of ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Male NPC: Only save the women??? Can't you save us?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hong Kong-style funny horror film style, allowing timid players to enjoy it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magical adventure with elements of love. Up to 5 beautiful women can develop feelings!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel back to the familiar 3D scenes of the 1990s.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 12 characters with distinct personalities appear, and you can also gain the favor of young ladies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players' actions can change the development of the plot. A total of 7 endings + one bad ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two gameplay methods: story mode without weapons and zombie mode with firearms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by Bilibili netizens or streamers for free. Thousands of lines of dialogue reveal the mystery for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a production time of up to 7 years, the story mode lasts for 7 hours and the zombie mode lasts for 3 hours. There's plenty to enjoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed independently by one person through self-study (poor development team)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known problems and solutions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If operating with the mouse, please unplug the gamepad or Bluetooth transmitter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the game crashes, increase the system's virtual memory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solution for not finding SAVE:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please select &quot;Browse Local Files&quot; on STEAM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the &quot;BlurredWeirdNight_DatadataSavedGame&quot; folder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move all the save files to another folder for backup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep only the last numbered save file. (Generally, the save file is 460K in size. If there is a 0K save file, delete it directly.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, if the last save file is &quot;Save68.sav&quot;, rename it to &quot;Save0.sav&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The &quot;.sav&quot; is the file extension. If it's not displayed on some systems, just rename it to &quot;Save0&quot;.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you can successfully load the game when you enter the game again.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by only one person, and it will be updated irregularly! If you have any problems, please join the QQ group 140130929 to solve them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 